# Private research materials -- must NOT be published.
# Unblinding keys map anonymous review IDs back to subject model + condition
# + per-judge scores; publishing them destroys the study's blinding and
# pre-reveals the answer key for any future human scoring. The blinded human
# packet is kept private until human adjudication is complete.
reports/*unblinding_key.csv
reports/human_adjudication_blinded_15.*
reports/qwen_claude_high_disagreement_review.*

